{"schema":"learning-v2-theory.v1","lesson":9,"lang":"uk","title":"Що відбувається зараз","sections":[{"num":"01","title":"Що ви навчитеся казати","defaultOpen":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"В уроці 6 ви казали про те, що буває регулярно: I work, she cooks. Тепер — про те, що відбувається просто зараз, на ваших очах: «я спостерігаю за птахами», «лід тане», «вона не куштує варення», «блискавка працює?»."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I am observing the birds.","translation":"Я спостерігаю за птахами.","hi":"am observing"},{"en":"The ice is melting.","translation":"Лід тане.","hi":"is melting"},{"en":"She is not tasting the jam.","translation":"Вона не куштує варення.","hi":"is not tasting"},{"en":"Is the zipper working?","translation":"Блискавка працює?","hi":"Is"}]}]},{"num":"02","title":"Скріпка + дія з -ing","defaultOpen":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Щоб сказати, що відбувається зараз, беруть знайому скріпку am, is, are і додають до дії -ing: I am watching. Потрібні обидві частини. Без скріпки (I watching) чи без -ing (I am watch) фраза ламається."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"хто","accent":false},{"text":"am / is / are","accent":true},{"text":"дія + ing","accent":false}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I am observing the birds.","translation":"Я спостерігаю за птахами.","hi":"am observing"},{"en":"She is watching a caterpillar.","translation":"Вона дивиться на гусінь.","hi":"is watching"},{"en":"They are using a magnifier.","translation":"Вони користуються лупою.","hi":"are using"},{"en":"I am knocking at the door.","translation":"Я стукаю у двері.","hi":"am knocking"},{"en":"A visitor is waiting.","translation":"Відвідувач чекає.","hi":"is waiting"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I observing the birds.","right":"I am observing the birds."},{"wrong":"I am observe the birds.","right":"I am observing the birds."},{"wrong":"She watching a caterpillar.","right":"She is watching a caterpillar."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"choice","kind":"choice","before":"She","after":"watching a caterpillar.","options":["is","are","—"],"answer":"is","why":"Перед дією з -ing потрібна скріпка, з she — is."}}]},{"num":"03","title":"Скріпка — та сама, що в уроці 1","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Яку скріпку взяти, вирішує «хто» — як на самому початку курсу. I — am, he, she, it та одна річ — is, you, we, they — are: I am sighing, the ice is melting, we are marching."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I am sighing with relief.","translation":"Я зітхаю з полегшенням.","hi":"am"},{"en":"He is sneezing.","translation":"Він чхає.","hi":"is"},{"en":"The firefly is glowing now.","translation":"Світлячок зараз світиться.","hi":"is"},{"en":"We are marching.","translation":"Ми маршируємо.","hi":"are"},{"en":"The leaves are whirling.","translation":"Листя кружляє.","hi":"are"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"The leaves is whirling.","right":"The leaves are whirling."},{"wrong":"We is marching.","right":"We are marching."}]}]},{"num":"04","title":"Як пишеться -ing","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Зазвичай -ing просто додають: watch → watching. Якщо слово закінчується на німе e, e прибирають: make → making. Якщо на короткий голосний і одну приголосну, приголосну подвоюють: clap → clapping, sit → sitting, hop → hopping."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I am making my portfolio.","translation":"Я збираю своє портфоліо.","hi":"making"},{"en":"I am sitting.","translation":"Я сиджу.","hi":"sitting"},{"en":"I am submitting my work.","translation":"Я здаю свою роботу.","hi":"submitting"},{"en":"The sparrow is hopping.","translation":"Горобець стрибає.","hi":"hopping"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I am makeing my portfolio.","right":"I am making my portfolio."},{"wrong":"I am siting.","right":"I am sitting."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"choice","kind":"choice","before":"I am","after":".","options":["siting","sitting","sit"],"answer":"sitting","why":"У sit короткий голосний і одна приголосна, тому t подвоюють."}}]},{"num":"05","title":"«Не» — not після скріпки","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"«Не» ставлять туди ж, куди й завжди, — одразу після скріпки: I am not guessing, she is not tasting the jam. Дія з -ing лишається."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"хто","accent":false},{"text":"am / is / are","accent":true},{"text":"not","accent":true},{"text":"дія + ing","accent":false}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I am not guessing.","translation":"Я не вгадую.","hi":"not"},{"en":"She is not tasting the jam.","translation":"Вона не куштує варення.","hi":"not"},{"en":"They are not looking.","translation":"Вони не дивляться.","hi":"not"},{"en":"The wax is not melting.","translation":"Віск не тане.","hi":"not"},{"en":"The drummer is not marching.","translation":"Барабанщик не марширує.","hi":"not"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I not guessing.","right":"I am not guessing."},{"wrong":"She doesn't tasting the jam.","right":"She is not tasting the jam."},{"wrong":"They are not look.","right":"They are not looking."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"spot_slip","kind":"spot_slip","chips":["She","doesn't","tasting","the","jam"],"answerIndex":1,"hint":"Одне слово тут не на місці. Натисніть на нього.","fix":"З -ing «не» — це is not: She is not tasting the jam."}}]},{"num":"06","title":"Питання: скріпку наперед","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Питання будують як в уроці 2: скріпку ставлять на початок. Is the ice melting? Are you inspecting the seam? Do і does тут не потрібні — їхнє місце в питаннях про звички."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"Am / Is / Are","accent":true},{"text":"хто","accent":false},{"text":"дія + ing","accent":false},{"text":"?","accent":true}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"Are you inspecting the seam?","translation":"Ви перевіряєте шов?","hi":"Are"},{"en":"Is she inspecting the lining?","translation":"Вона перевіряє підкладку?","hi":"Is"},{"en":"Is the zipper working?","translation":"Блискавка працює?","hi":"Is"},{"en":"Is he sighing?","translation":"Він зітхає?","hi":"Is"},{"en":"Is the chocolate melting?","translation":"Шоколад тане?","hi":"Is"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"Do you inspecting the seam?","right":"Are you inspecting the seam?"},{"wrong":"The chocolate is melting?","right":"Is the chocolate melting?"}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"word_bank","kind":"word_bank","prompt":"Спитайте: «Шоколад тане?»","answer":["Is","the","chocolate","melting"],"distractors":["Does","melt"]}}]},{"num":"07","title":"Зараз — чи зазвичай?","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"I wear a sweatshirt — «я ношу світшот» (зазвичай, загалом). I am sweating — «я зараз пітнію». Українською це часто звучить однаково, а в англійській це різні фрази. Спитайте себе: це звичка чи просто зараз?"},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I wear a sweatshirt.","translation":"Я ношу світшот. *(зазвичай)*","hi":"wear"},{"en":"I am sweating.","translation":"Я зараз пітнію.","hi":"am sweating"},{"en":"The firefly is glowing now.","translation":"Світлячок зараз світиться.","hi":"is glowing"}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"binary","kind":"binary","question":"Просто зараз лід на сходах тане. Як сказати?","optionA":"The ice melts.","optionB":"The ice is melting.","correct":"B","explain":"Це відбувається зараз, тому is melting."}}]},{"num":"08","title":"Щось відбувається — і де","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"До фрази про те, що відбувається, легко додати, де: She is in the doorway. I am near the carousel. Це знайома скріпка з місцем — без -ing, бо дії тут немає."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"She is in the doorway.","translation":"Вона у дверях.","hi":"is"},{"en":"I am near the carousel.","translation":"Я біля каруселі.","hi":"am"},{"en":"She is murmuring to the baby.","translation":"Вона щось шепоче малюкові.","hi":"is murmuring"},{"en":"My hands are trembling.","translation":"У мене тремтять руки.","hi":"are trembling"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I am being near the carousel.","right":"I am near the carousel."}]}]},{"num":"09","title":"Помилки, яких припускаються майже всі","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I observing the birds.","right":"I am observing the birds."},{"wrong":"I am observe the birds.","right":"I am observing the birds."},{"wrong":"The leaves is whirling.","right":"The leaves are whirling."},{"wrong":"I am siting.","right":"I am sitting."},{"wrong":"I am makeing my portfolio.","right":"I am making my portfolio."},{"wrong":"She doesn't tasting the jam.","right":"She is not tasting the jam."},{"wrong":"Do you inspecting the seam?","right":"Are you inspecting the seam?"}]},{"kind":"tip","text":"Дві частини завжди разом: скріпка і -ing. Є одна — шукайте другу. А do і does у ці фрази не беріть."}]},{"num":"10","title":"Що взяти з собою в практику","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Зараз — am / is / are + дія з -ing. «Не» — not після скріпки. Питання — скріпку наперед. Пишіть уважно: making, sitting, hopping. Звичка — як в уроці 6, без -ing."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"They are using a magnifier.","translation":"Вони користуються лупою.","hi":"are using"},{"en":"They are not looking.","translation":"Вони не дивляться.","hi":"not"},{"en":"Is she inspecting the lining?","translation":"Вона перевіряє підкладку?","hi":"Is"},{"en":"I am submitting my work.","translation":"Я здаю свою роботу.","hi":"submitting"}]}]}],"sessionSection":{"1":"02","2":"03","3":"02","4":"02","5":"02","6":"02","7":"02","8":"02","9":"05","10":"05","11":"05","12":"05","13":"05","14":"05","15":"05","16":"05","17":"06","18":"06","19":"06","20":"06","21":"06","22":"06","23":"06","24":"06","25":"07","26":"07","27":"07","28":"07","29":"07","30":"07","31":"07","32":"07","33":"04","34":"04","35":"04","36":"04","37":"04","38":"04","39":"04","40":"04","41":"08","42":"08","43":"08","44":"08","45":"08","46":"08","47":"08","48":"08","49":"08","50":"08","51":"08","52":"08","53":"08","54":"08","55":"08","56":"08"}}
